  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-pink pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Total Drain</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4c/FFVI_Raid.png/revision/latest?cb=20180524221836\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"FFVI Raid\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4c/FFVI_Raid.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180524221836\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4c/FFVI_Raid.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180524221836 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4c/FFVI_Raid.png/revision/latest?cb=20180524221836 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"FFVI Raid\" width=\"270\" height=\"180\" data-image-key=\"FFVI_Raid.png\" data-image-name=\"FFVI Raid.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">As an enhanced version of Drain, Raid (Final Fantasy VI) can completely empty you of all energy with a single application/attack, even if your HP and MP are full.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Drain all energy from individuals or objects.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>siphon all energy from objects, creatures, or existing energies</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Total_Conversion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Total Conversion\">Total Conversion</a>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Energy Absorption\">Absolute Energy Absorption</a>. Advanced version of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Drain\" title=\"Energy Drain\">Energy Drain</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Powers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Powers</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTotal_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Complete Drain/Draining</li>\n<li>Complete Leech/Siphon</li>\n<li>Total Draining</li>\n<li>Total Leech/Siphon</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTotal_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User can drain/leech/siphon completely anything/everything of any/all forms of energy, possibly/potentially even down to the energy holding your atoms/molecules together. Making the target physically weaker, causing extreme fatigue or even leaving near death or breaking them down entirely while gaining their strength and stamina in the process.\n</p><p>No matter how much energy, life-force or stamina the target may have, they can completely empty all of it in a single drain/leeching even if the target is at full health/peak capacity.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTotal_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Atomic_Consumption\" title=\"Atomic Consumption\">Atomic Consumption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Disintegration\" title=\"Disintegration\">Disintegration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Draining_Field_Projection\" title=\"Draining Field Projection\">Draining Field Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enervation_Inducement\" title=\"Enervation Inducement\">Enervation Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Entropy_Acceleration\" title=\"Entropy Acceleration\">Entropy Acceleration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Health_Drain\" title=\"Health Drain\">Health Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitation_Inducement\" title=\"Incapacitation Inducement\">Incapacitation Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stamina_Absorption\" title=\"Stamina Absorption\">Stamina Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength_Absorption\" title=\"Strength Absorption\">Strength Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTotal_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Absorption\">Absolute Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Energy Absorption\">Absolute Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Element_Drain\" title=\"Element Drain\">Element Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Drain\" title=\"Energy Drain\">Energy Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fatigue_Manipulation\" title=\"Fatigue Manipulation\">Fatigue Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Total_Conversion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Total Conversion\">Total Conversion</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTotal_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be constantly active.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Independence\" title=\"Energy Independence\">Energy Independence</a> may be immune.</li>\n<li>Cannot fully drain users of <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Life-Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Life-Force\">Absolute Life-Force</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTotal_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Users of Raid (<i>Final Fantasy VI</i>)</li>\n<li>Bellcross (<i>Heroic Age</i>)</li>\n<li>Shinju (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Orgathe (<i>The Night Dawns Trilogy</i>); via <a href=\"/wiki/Entropy_Acceleration\" title=\"Entropy Acceleration\">Entropy Acceleration</a></li>\n<li>Alastor (<i>Shakugan no Shana</i>); when physically summoned</li>\n<li>Shadow Creature (<i>Stargate Atlantis</i>)</li>\n<li>Guinness (<i>Toriko</i>); via <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitation_Inducement\" title=\"Incapacitation Inducement\">Incapacitation Inducement</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Powers\">Known Powers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTotal_Drain%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Raid (<i>Final Fantasy VI</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260801225934\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 119/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 202/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.541      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    8.541      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:303706-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260801225934 and revision id 2858021. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
